{"repositoryId":929088050,"availability":"available","full":"live-miracles/vmix-master","name":"vmix-master","description":"A complete control panel for vMix in your browser: one system or several working as one. Inputs by name, audio, playback, overlays, sync scripts. Try the live demo, no vMix needed.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-02-07T19:33:54Z","updated":"2026-10-15T09:28:56Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://live-miracles.github.io/vmix-master/","topics":["broadcast","control-panel","daisyui","live-production","live-streaming","livestream","pwa","remote-control","tailwindcss","typescript","video-production","vmix","vmix-api","vmix-scripts","web-controller"],"demo":"https://live-miracles.github.io/vmix-master/?demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:58.143Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:58.143Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:58.143Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:58.143Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A complete control panel for vMix in your browser: one system, or several working as one. Nothing to install."],"features":["Group control: commands from the panel go to the master and every vMix in its group. The master is marked on its group button.","Program and preview: large timers, a position slider, Restart and Play/Pause, and six transition buttons (Quick Play, Cut, Stinger 1, Stinger 2, Fade, FTB).","Names, not codes: every input is shown by its name, so you can tell what is what at a glance.","Inputs and audio: every input as a tile with overlays 1–6, loop, volume, and send-to-bus buttons, plus the audio buses with live level meters.","At-a-glance status: each vMix has a status dot (connected, unreachable, no address), and its program and preview inputs."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/live-miracles/vmix-master/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"cbd0b0bf39cb510429dc